orld's largest enterprise software company. With annual revenues of more than $10.8 billion, Oracle offers its database, tools and application products, along with related consulting, education, and support services.  \nOracle Support Services provides technical and operational expertise for all Oracle technology and applications.  \nOracle is a registered trademark of Oracle Corporation. Other names may be trademarks of their respective owners.  \nAll Rights Reserved. No part of this publication may be reprinted or otherwise reproduced without permission from the publisher.  \nCopyright © 2008 Oracle Corporation.")]
